@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:security;concurrency] ingress-authority-serialization
Endpoint mutations MUST hold the VM row lock and authorize current persisted
membership through Cedar. Stable labels MUST NOT change with configuration,
relocation or VM name reuse. Raw resource mutations remain trusted internal only.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:architecture] ingress-ash-authority
Ash/PostgreSQL own endpoint identity, visibility and policy revisions. Audi caches
and DNS publications MUST NOT independently create or extend authorization.
Audit records MUST commit with the corresponding business mutation.
